Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libx11-6, libxext6, libasound2t64 | libasound2
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Doggydoggywhatnow/Peep
Description: music player that is just a screen
 Peep opens as a black square. Drop a folder or files on it and it plays
 them, showing the album cover from the files' own tags; the window takes
 the cover's shape. Tab shows the track info and controls while the pointer
 is over the window.
 .
 Written in x86-64 assembly. No network code, no telemetry, no library
 database, and it never writes to disk.
